                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Generally, it's not that bad.\nPros:\n- nice music\n- fine animations\n- smooth ship control\nCons, though:\n- terrible shooting controls (one click - one shot? in a game like this? seriously?)\n- bad SFX (it sounds like it's from some free pack)\n- not good difficulty raise (it gets from a park walk to the nightmarish hell in a blink of an eye)\n- it generally lacks some style and looks like student's project for a half-year.\n\n4/10 - worth trying, if you get it for free.",
